Third-party code
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
This repository contains no third-party source code.

Dependencies that are fetched, not committed:
  * Vulkan-Headers (Apache-2.0) ......... third_party/vulkan-headers/
  * pybind11 (BSD-3-Clause) ............. build dependency
  * NumPy (BSD-3-Clause) ................ runtime dependency

Benchmark baselines (NOT distributed, NOT linked, NOT derived from):
  * ggml / llama.cpp Vulkan backend (MIT) ... benchmarks/upstream/ggml/
  * ncnn Vulkan backend (BSD-3-Clause) ...... benchmarks/upstream/ncnn/
  * CLBlast (Apache-2.0) .................... benchmarks/upstream/clblast/

These are cloned and built out-of-tree solely to produce reference throughput
numbers on identical hardware and shapes. No code from them is copied into,
linked against, or shipped with VulTorch. Their results are published as
comparison baselines with attribution, per docs/kernels/DERIVATION.md.
